      "description": "Paper-filled field with global focus outline and library focus state.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\">Title<input placeholder=\"Write a title\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:block;font:500 13px/1.75 Arial, \"Leelawadee UI\", Tahoma, sans-serif;color:var(--foreground,#242320)}.ds-field input{display:block;width:100%;min-width:0;margin-top:6px;height:41px;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #ded9d0;border-radius:6px;background:#fffdfa;color:var(--foreground,#242320);font:400 16px/1.75 Arial, \"Leelawadee UI\", Tahoma, sans-serif;transition:color .15s,box-shadow .15s}.ds-field input::placeholder{color:var(--muted-foreground,#6d685f)}.ds-field input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring,#426cce);outline-offset:4px;border-color:var(--ring,#426cce)}.ds-field input[aria-invalid=true]{border-color:var(--destructive,#c43223)}.ds-field input:disabled{opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}@media(max-width:700px),(pointer:coarse){.ds-field input{min-height:44px}}"
